WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.870
All right, I think it's safe to say

2
00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:04.890
that most of us wouldn't mind

3
00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:08.360
having our next guest as their Valentine.

4
00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:10.490
He can sing and act and dance,

5
00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:13.250
and he's added author to his repertoire

6
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.720
with his 5th children's book.

7
00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:17.290
Please welcome back

8
00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.848
to the show our friend, Taye Diggs.

9
00:00:19.848 --> 00:00:22.848
(audience cheering)

10
00:00:26.286 --> 00:00:29.369
Now, since you were last on the show, you joined TikTok.

11
00:00:31.494 --> 00:00:32.930
(laughs) Yes.

12
00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:35.440
And your videos are getting a lot of attention.

13
00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:39.320
One has just, you know, 11 million views plus.

14
00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.617
I have a clip, take a look.

15
00:00:41.617 --> 00:00:44.367
(singing noises)

16
00:00:46.003 --> 00:00:48.461
♪ Jerk, jerk, jerk, jerk, jerk, jerk, jerk, jerk ♪

17
00:00:48.461 --> 00:00:50.663
♪ Everybody look at me jerk ♪

18
00:00:50.663 --> 00:00:52.962
♪ I'm a jerk, you're a jerk, ♪

19
00:00:52.962 --> 00:00:56.568
♪ and everybody's a jerk, jerk, jerk ♪

20
00:00:56.568 --> 00:00:59.568
(audience laughter)

21
00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:02.140
Where did the idea

22
00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:04.460
for this one come or was it just spontaneous?

23
00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:05.630
Did it just burst out of you?

24
00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:06.463
Were you in a mood?

25
00:01:06.463 --> 00:01:08.483
How did this, what's the origin story?

26
00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.220
So look, I'm, I'm old, right?

27
00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:14.070 line:15%
So I work with a bunch of young people.

28
00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:16.710 line:15%
You know, I have a 13 year old son

29
00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:19.190 line:15%
and I'm constantly being reminded, you know

30
00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:21.180 line:15%
of how unhip I am.

31
00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:23.770
So I watched TikTok with my kid

32
00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:26.750
so I can see what what's going on with the young folks.

33
00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:30.280
So I just started to try to make up versions

34
00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:34.960
of what I saw on TikTok myself and we laugh at it.

35
00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:37.268
You know, my son is, is, is always recording me

36
00:01:37.268 --> 00:01:40.290
(audience clapping)

37
00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:41.123
There you go.

38
00:01:41.123 --> 00:01:42.900
But you're also a huge prankster

39
00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:43.823
Is this true?

40
00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:47.790
I enjoy a, a practical joke, yeah.

41
00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:50.700
Back when my baby mama Idina Menzel

42
00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:53.200
back when we were in New York doing Rent,

43
00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:58.030
I left the theater early so I could beat her home

44
00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:03.030
and I hid in her closet and I scared her

45
00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:05.610
so badly that she immediately bursts

46
00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:08.070
into tears and ran out of the apartment.

47
00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:10.453
So it, it doesn't, it doesn't sound funny when I

48
00:02:10.453 --> 00:02:11.720
when I tell it to you right now,

49
00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:13.918
but I laughed in the moment.

50
00:02:13.918 --> 00:02:16.501
(upbeat music)

